OL,4,BDonald aims for England T20 chance in  
OL,5,BAustralia                              
OL,6,GFrom Gorseinon cricket club in Swansea 
OL,7,Gto some of the most famous grounds in  
OL,8,GAustralia.                             
OL,10,FThat is the journey England's latest   
OL,11,FWelsh batter Aneurin Donald is         
OL,12,Fpreparing to complete when the T20     
OL,13,Ffive-match series starts against       
OL,14,FAustralia on Saturday.                 
OL,16,FDonald made his England debut in the   
OL,17,Fhome three-match series against Sri    
OL,18,FLanka but this tour represents a step  
OL,19,Fup.                                    
